item: u4-l5-choice-fast

card c04
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Put it on the scale
figure: dose-ladder
figure_at: 1

body:
    Compare a number with the doses you know. An average year is about 6 millisieverts. A whole body CT is about 10. Acute illness starts at about 1000, in a short time.

