card c07
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Two wrong answers
figure: two-myths
figure_at: 1

body:
    One wrong answer says any dose is deadly. The other says radiation is harmless. Both are wrong. A very large dose in a short time makes people ill, and low doses add a small chance of cancer over a lifetime. Size and speed decide.

