card c11
kind: teach
type: explain
tier: deeper
scored: 0
title: Go deeper: a number to remember
figure: dose-ladder
figure_at: 1

body:
    About 1000 millisieverts in a short time is where illness starts. An average year is about 6. That is a gap of well over a hundred times.
